# TR Necrom: "Old Soldiers" (TR_m2_Nm_Vorith). In Necrom's Upper District the Indoril soldier Vorith asks the player
# to "pay his respects" ("I will fulfil your vow." 1: 10, his sword and ring). His widow Emeni Udani in Seitur, given
# the tokens ("Offer Vorith's tokens." 1, then "A Dunmer named Vorith gave them to me at Necrom." 2), learns he
# found his way to the ancestors (20).
# Position and PositionCell stand in for the travel.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ht_nu1_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case nm_vorith_start
run
player->Position 361526 -87200 1440 0
until 900 "TR_m2_Vorith"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m2_Vorith
ask pay his respects
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Vorith == 10
expect player->GetItemCount "TR_m2_q_A9_4_VorithRing" == 1
bye
end

case nm_vorith_done
run
player->PositionCell 200 -200 -100 0 "Seitur, Emeni Udani's House"
until 600 "TR_m3_Emeni Udani"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 120
talk TR_m3_Emeni Udani
ask Emeni Udani
choose 1
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m2_Nm_Vorith == 20
bye
end
